Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: The friendly interactive shell
 fish suggests the rest of a command as you type it, colours mistakes before you
 run them, and completes flags from the tool's own help — with nothing to
 configure first. This build is patched to start commands without fork, which is
 what makes it work on iOS. Run `fish` in a terminal; your settings live in
 ~/.config/fish.
